(function(){var T=window.TRANSLATIONS;if(!T)return;var d={"tr":{"blog_p94_heavyrack_title":"Ağır Yük ve Konsol Raf İmalatı: Standart Raf Yetmediğinde Kaynaklı Çözümler | ArmaWeld","blog_p94_heavyrack_meta_desc":"Kalıp rafları, bobin rafları, konsol (cantilever) raflar ve uzun malzeme depolama sistemlerinin kaynaklı imalatı: yük hesabı, kol bağlantısı, ankraj, sehim, etiketleme, boya ve montaj.","blog_p94_heavyrack_og_title":"Ağır yük ve konsol raf imalatı","blog_p94_heavyrack_tag":"Ürün Rehberi · Depolama","blog_p94_heavyrack_h1":"Ağır Yük ve Konsol Raf İmalatı: Standart Raf Yetmediğinde Kaynaklı Çözümler","blog_p94_heavyrack_breadcrumb3":"Ağır yük rafı","blog_p94_heavyrack_read":"6 dk okuma","blog_p94_heavyrack_body":"<p>Palet rafları büyük ölçüde soğuk şekillendirilmiş, seri üretilmiş, cıvatalı sistemlerdir ve kendi standartlarına göre tasarlanır. Ancak bazı yükler bu sistemlere uymaz: tonlarca ağırlığındaki pres kalıpları, sac bobinleri, 12 metrelik profiller ve borular, makine parçaları. Bu yükler için genellikle sıcak haddelenmiş profillerden kaynaklı, projeye özel raflar tasarlanır ve imal edilir.</p>\n<h2>Tipik Özel Raf Türleri</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Kalıp rafları:</strong> Ağır kalıplar için çekmeceli veya sabit raflar; raf tablaları kalın sac veya ızgara.</li>\n<li><strong>Bobin rafları:</strong> Sac bobinleri için V yataklı veya beşik tipi raflar.</li>\n<li><strong>Konsol (cantilever) raflar:</strong> Uzun malzemeler için tek veya çift taraflı kollu raflar.</li>\n<li><strong>Dikey ve çekmeceli raflar:</strong> Sac levhalar ve uzun profiller için.</li>\n<li><strong>Taşıyıcı sehpa ve paletler:</strong> Fabrika içi ağır parça depolama.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Yük ve Tasarım</h2>\n<p>Özel rafların tasarımında raf seviyesi başına yük, toplam kolon yükü, kol ucundaki sehim ve devrilme güvenliği hesaplanmalıdır. Konsol raflarda kol-kolon bağlantısı en kritik noktadır: kol ucundaki yük, bağlantıda büyük bir moment oluşturur. Bu bağlantı kaynaklı ise dikiş ölçüsü hesapla belirlenmelidir (bkz. <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-mukavemet-hesabi.html\">kaynak dikişi mukavemet hesabı</a>); ayarlanabilir kollar isteniyorsa cıvatalı/pimli bağlantı tercih edilir (bkz. <a href=\"kaynakli-mi-civatali-mi-birlestirme.html\">kaynaklı mı cıvatalı mı</a>).</p>\n<h2>Ankraj ve Sehim</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Raflar zemine ankrajlanmalı; ankraj plakası ve dübel seçimi zemin betonuna göre yapılmalıdır.</li>\n<li>Forklift darbesine karşı kolon koruyucuları planlanmalıdır.</li>\n<li>Kol ucu sehimi, yükün kaymasını ve kolun kalıcı deformasyonunu önleyecek sınırlar içinde tutulmalıdır.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>İmalat ve Ölçü</h2>\n<p>Kolonlardaki kol yuvalarının hizası, kolların aynı seviyede ve yatay olmasını sağlar. Bu nedenle kolon imalatında delik ve yuva aralıkları fikstürle veya CNC kesimle tutulur; genel toleranslar için ISO 13920 sınıfı belirtilmelidir (bkz. <a href=\"iso-13920-kaynakli-imalat-tolerans-tablosu.html\">ISO 13920</a>).</p>\n<h2>Etiket ve Güvenlik</h2>\n<p>Her rafın üzerinde seviye başına ve toplam izin verilen yükü gösteren kapasite etiketi bulunmalıdır. Kullanıcılar etiketteki yük aşılmadan kullanmalı; hasarlı kolon ve kollar periyodik kontrollerde değiştirilmelidir.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>ArmaWeld'de:</strong> Kalıp, bobin ve konsol rafları müşterinin onaylı tasarımına göre kaynaklıyor; kol yuvası hizasını fikstürle tutup ölçü raporuyla teslim ediyoruz. Kesim ve boyayı iş ortaklarımızla koordine ediyoruz. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Çelik konstrüksiyon →</a></p></div>","blog_p94_heavyrack_faq":"<h2>Sık Sorulan Sorular</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Standart palet rafı yerine ne zaman özel raf gerekir?</h3><p>Kalıp, bobin, uzun profil gibi standart raf sistemlerine uymayan ağır veya uzun yüklerde.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Konsol rafta en kritik nokta nedir?</h3><p>Kol-kolon bağlantısı; kol ucundaki yük burada büyük moment oluşturur.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Raflar zemine ankrajlanmalı mı?</h3><p>Evet; ankraj plakası ve dübel zemin betonuna göre seçilir.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Rafta kapasite etiketi zorunlu mu?</h3><p>Seviye başına ve toplam izin verilen yükü gösteren etiket olmalıdır.</p></div>","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_h3":"Ağır yük veya konsol raf mı gerekiyor?","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_p":"Tasarım çizimlerini gönderin; kaynaklı raf teklifini hazırlayalım.","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_btn":"Teklif İste →","blog_related_h":"İlgili Makaleler","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Çelik Konstrüksiyon İmalat: Tasarımdan Montaja","blog_p14_strength_h1":"Kaynak Dikişi Mukavemet Hesabı: EN 1993-1-8 ile Köşe ve Alın Kaynağı","blog_p04_iso13920_h1":"ISO 13920 Genel Toleranslar: Kaynaklı İmalat Tolerans Tablosu ve Doğru Sınıf Seçimi","blog_p19_boltweld_h1":"Kaynaklı mı Cıvatalı mı? Birleştirme Yöntemi Seçimi İçin Mühendislik Rehberi"},"en":{"blog_p94_heavyrack_title":"Heavy-Duty and Cantilever Rack Fabrication: Welded Solutions When Standard Racking Isn't Enough | ArmaWeld","blog_p94_heavyrack_meta_desc":"Welded fabrication of die racks, coil racks, cantilever racks and long material storage: load calculation, arm connections, anchoring, deflection, load signs, painting and installation.","blog_p94_heavyrack_og_title":"Heavy-duty and cantilever rack fabrication","blog_p94_heavyrack_tag":"Product Guide · Storage","blog_p94_heavyrack_h1":"Heavy-Duty and Cantilever Rack Fabrication: Welded Solutions When Standard Racking Isn't Enough","blog_p94_heavyrack_breadcrumb3":"Heavy-duty racks","blog_p94_heavyrack_read":"6 min read","blog_p94_heavyrack_body":"<p>Pallet racking is largely cold-formed, mass-produced and bolted, designed to its own standards. Some loads do not fit those systems: press dies weighing tonnes, steel coils, 12-metre sections and pipes, machine parts. For these, project-specific racks are usually designed and welded from hot-rolled sections.</p>\n<h2>Typical Special Rack Types</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Die racks:</strong> drawer or fixed racks for heavy dies; shelves of thick plate or grating.</li>\n<li><strong>Coil racks:</strong> V-saddle or cradle racks for steel coils.</li>\n<li><strong>Cantilever racks:</strong> single or double-sided arm racks for long materials.</li>\n<li><strong>Vertical and drawer racks:</strong> for sheet and long sections.</li>\n<li><strong>Stillages and pallets:</strong> in-plant heavy part storage.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Load and Design</h2>\n<p>Special racks need calculations for load per level, total column load, arm tip deflection and overturning safety. In cantilever racks, the arm-to-column connection is the most critical point: the load at the arm tip creates a large moment there. If welded, the weld size must be calculated (see <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-mukavemet-hesabi.html\">weld strength calculation</a>); for adjustable arms, bolted/pinned connections are preferred (see <a href=\"kaynakli-mi-civatali-mi-birlestirme.html\">welded or bolted</a>).</p>\n<h2>Anchoring and Deflection</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Racks must be anchored; base plates and anchors chosen to suit the floor slab.</li>\n<li>Column guards against forklift impact should be planned.</li>\n<li>Arm tip deflection kept within limits that prevent load sliding and permanent arm deformation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Fabrication and Dimensions</h2>\n<p>Alignment of arm seats on columns keeps arms level and horizontal. So hole and seat spacing on columns is held by fixtures or CNC cutting; the ISO 13920 class for general tolerances should be specified (see <a href=\"iso-13920-kaynakli-imalat-tolerans-tablosu.html\">ISO 13920</a>).</p>\n<h2>Load Signs and Safety</h2>\n<p>Each rack should carry a load sign showing permissible load per level and in total. Users must not exceed it, and damaged columns and arms should be replaced at periodic inspections.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>At ArmaWeld:</strong> we weld die, coil and cantilever racks to the customer's approved design, hold arm seat alignment with fixtures and deliver with a dimensional report. Cutting and painting are coordinated with our partners. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Steel structures →</a></p></div>","blog_p94_heavyrack_faq":"<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>When is a special rack needed instead of pallet racking?</h3><p>For heavy or long loads such as dies, coils and long sections that don't fit standard systems.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>What is most critical in a cantilever rack?</h3><p>The arm-to-column connection; the arm tip load creates a large moment there.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Must racks be anchored?</h3><p>Yes; base plates and anchors are chosen for the floor slab.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Is a load sign required?</h3><p>There should be a sign showing permissible load per level and in total.</p></div>","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_h3":"Need heavy-duty or cantilever racks?","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_p":"Send the design drawings; we will quote the welded racks.","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_btn":"Request a Quote →","blog_related_h":"Related Articles","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Steel Structure Manufacturing: From Design to Erection","blog_p14_strength_h1":"Weld Strength Calculation: Fillet and Butt Welds to EN 1993-1-8","blog_p04_iso13920_h1":"ISO 13920 General Tolerances: Tolerance Table for Welded Constructions and Choosing the Right Class","blog_p19_boltweld_h1":"Welded or Bolted? An Engineering Guide to Choosing the Connection"},"de":{"blog_p94_heavyrack_title":"Schwerlast- und Kragarmregale fertigen: geschweißte Lösungen, wenn Standardregale nicht reichen | ArmaWeld","blog_p94_heavyrack_meta_desc":"Schweißfertigung von Werkzeugregalen, Coilregalen, Kragarmregalen und Langgutlagern: Lastberechnung, Armanschluss, Verankerung, Durchbiegung, Belastungsschilder, Lackierung und Montage.","blog_p94_heavyrack_og_title":"Schwerlast- und Kragarmregale","blog_p94_heavyrack_tag":"Produktleitfaden · Lagertechnik","blog_p94_heavyrack_h1":"Schwerlast- und Kragarmregale fertigen: geschweißte Lösungen, wenn Standardregale nicht reichen","blog_p94_heavyrack_breadcrumb3":"Schwerlastregale","blog_p94_heavyrack_read":"6 Min. Lesezeit","blog_p94_heavyrack_body":"<p>Palettenregale sind überwiegend kaltprofilierte, seriengefertigte, verschraubte Systeme nach eigenen Normen. Manche Lasten passen nicht hinein: tonnenschwere Presswerkzeuge, Coils, 12-Meter-Profile und Rohre, Maschinenteile. Dafür werden meist projektspezifische Regale aus warmgewalzten Profilen konstruiert und geschweißt.</p>\n<h2>Typische Sonderregale</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Werkzeugregale:</strong> Schubladen- oder Festregale für schwere Werkzeuge; Böden aus Dickblech oder Gitterrost.</li>\n<li><strong>Coilregale:</strong> V-Auflagen oder Muldenregale für Blechcoils.</li>\n<li><strong>Kragarmregale:</strong> ein- oder doppelseitig für Langgut.</li>\n<li><strong>Vertikal- und Wabenregale:</strong> für Bleche und Langprofile.</li>\n<li><strong>Gestelle und Ladungsträger:</strong> innerbetriebliche Schwerteillagerung.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Last und Konstruktion</h2>\n<p>Sonderregale brauchen Nachweise für Fachlast, Stützenlast, Durchbiegung am Armende und Kippsicherheit. Beim Kragarmregal ist der Arm-Stützen-Anschluss die kritischste Stelle: Die Last am Armende erzeugt dort ein großes Moment. Ist er geschweißt, muss die Naht bemessen werden (siehe <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-mukavemet-hesabi.html\">Nahtberechnung</a>); für verstellbare Arme werden geschraubte oder gesteckte Anschlüsse bevorzugt (siehe <a href=\"kaynakli-mi-civatali-mi-birlestirme.html\">geschweißt oder geschraubt</a>).</p>\n<h2>Verankerung und Durchbiegung</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Regale werden verankert; Fußplatten und Dübel passend zur Bodenplatte.</li>\n<li>Anfahrschutz für Stützen gegen Staplerstöße einplanen.</li>\n<li>Durchbiegung am Armende so begrenzen, dass Ladung nicht rutscht und der Arm nicht bleibend verformt.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Fertigung und Maße</h2>\n<p>Die Fluchtung der Armaufnahmen an den Stützen hält die Arme waagrecht und auf gleicher Höhe. Loch- und Aufnahmeabstände werden daher mit Vorrichtungen oder CNC-Schnitt gehalten; die ISO-13920-Klasse für Allgemeintoleranzen gehört auf die Zeichnung (siehe <a href=\"iso-13920-kaynakli-imalat-tolerans-tablosu.html\">ISO 13920</a>).</p>\n<h2>Belastungsschild und Sicherheit</h2>\n<p>Jedes Regal trägt ein Schild mit zulässiger Fach- und Gesamtlast. Nutzer dürfen diese nicht überschreiten; beschädigte Stützen und Arme werden bei der regelmäßigen Prüfung ersetzt.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Bei ArmaWeld:</strong> Wir schweißen Werkzeug-, Coil- und Kragarmregale nach der freigegebenen Konstruktion des Kunden, halten die Armaufnahmen per Vorrichtung in Flucht und liefern mit Maßbericht. Zuschnitt und Lackierung koordinieren wir mit Partnern. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Stahlbau →</a></p></div>","blog_p94_heavyrack_faq":"<h2>Häufige Fragen</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Wann ein Sonderregal statt Palettenregal?</h3><p>Bei schweren oder langen Lasten wie Werkzeugen, Coils oder Langprofilen.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Kritischste Stelle beim Kragarmregal?</h3><p>Der Arm-Stützen-Anschluss; dort entsteht ein großes Moment.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Müssen Regale verankert werden?</h3><p>Ja; Fußplatten und Dübel passend zum Boden.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Ist ein Belastungsschild nötig?</h3><p>Ja, mit zulässiger Fach- und Gesamtlast.</p></div>","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_h3":"Schwerlast- oder Kragarmregale benötigt?","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_p":"Senden Sie die Konstruktionszeichnungen; wir bieten die geschweißten Regale an.","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_btn":"Angebot anfordern →","blog_related_h":"Verwandte Artikel","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Stahlkonstruktion: Von der Konstruktion zur Montage","blog_p14_strength_h1":"Schweißnahtberechnung: Kehl- und Stumpfnähte nach EN 1993-1-8","blog_p04_iso13920_h1":"ISO 13920 Allgemeintoleranzen: Toleranztabelle für Schweißkonstruktionen und die richtige Klasse","blog_p19_boltweld_h1":"Geschweißt oder geschraubt? Ein technischer Leitfaden zur Wahl der Verbindung"},"es":{"blog_p94_heavyrack_title":"Estanterías de carga pesada y cantilever: soluciones soldadas cuando la estándar no basta | ArmaWeld","blog_p94_heavyrack_meta_desc":"Fabricación soldada de estanterías para moldes, bobinas, cantilever y material largo: cálculo de cargas, unión de brazos, anclaje, flecha, placas de carga, pintura y montaje.","blog_p94_heavyrack_og_title":"Estanterías de carga pesada y cantilever","blog_p94_heavyrack_tag":"Guía de producto · Almacenaje","blog_p94_heavyrack_h1":"Estanterías de carga pesada y cantilever: soluciones soldadas cuando la estándar no basta","blog_p94_heavyrack_breadcrumb3":"Estanterías de carga pesada","blog_p94_heavyrack_read":"6 min de lectura","blog_p94_heavyrack_body":"<p>Las estanterías de palés son en gran parte sistemas conformados en frío, fabricados en serie y atornillados, diseñados según sus propias normas. Algunas cargas no encajan: matrices de prensa de varias toneladas, bobinas, perfiles y tubos de 12 metros, piezas de máquina. Para ellas se diseñan y sueldan estanterías a medida con perfiles laminados en caliente.</p>\n<h2>Tipos habituales</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Estanterías para moldes:</strong> con cajones o fijas; bandejas de chapa gruesa o tramex.</li>\n<li><strong>Estanterías para bobinas:</strong> con cunas en V.</li>\n<li><strong>Cantilever:</strong> de brazos a una o dos caras para material largo.</li>\n<li><strong>Verticales y de cajones:</strong> para chapas y perfiles largos.</li>\n<li><strong>Bastidores y contenedores:</strong> almacenaje interno de piezas pesadas.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Carga y diseño</h2>\n<p>Hay que calcular carga por nivel, carga en pilar, flecha en la punta del brazo y seguridad al vuelco. En cantilever, la unión brazo-pilar es lo más crítico: la carga en la punta genera allí un gran momento. Si es soldada, el cordón debe calcularse (ver <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-mukavemet-hesabi.html\">cálculo de cordones</a>); para brazos regulables se prefieren uniones atornilladas o con pasador (ver <a href=\"kaynakli-mi-civatali-mi-birlestirme.html\">soldado o atornillado</a>).</p>\n<h2>Anclaje y flecha</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Las estanterías se anclan; placas y tacos según la solera.</li>\n<li>Protectores de pilar frente a impactos de carretilla.</li>\n<li>Flecha en la punta limitada para que la carga no deslice ni el brazo se deforme.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Fabricación y medidas</h2>\n<p>La alineación de los alojamientos de brazos mantiene los brazos horizontales y al mismo nivel. Por eso los pasos de taladros y alojamientos se controlan con utillaje o corte CNC; debe indicarse la clase ISO 13920 (ver <a href=\"iso-13920-kaynakli-imalat-tolerans-tablosu.html\">ISO 13920</a>).</p>\n<h2>Placa de carga y seguridad</h2>\n<p>Cada estantería debe llevar una placa con la carga admisible por nivel y total. No debe superarse, y los pilares o brazos dañados se sustituyen en las revisiones periódicas.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>En ArmaWeld:</strong> soldamos estanterías para moldes, bobinas y cantilever según el diseño aprobado por el cliente, mantenemos la alineación de alojamientos con utillaje y entregamos con informe dimensional. Corte y pintura se coordinan con socios. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Estructuras metálicas →</a></p></div>","blog_p94_heavyrack_faq":"<h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Cuándo hace falta una estantería especial?</h3><p>Con cargas pesadas o largas como moldes, bobinas o perfiles largos.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Qué es lo más crítico en cantilever?</h3><p>La unión brazo-pilar; allí se genera un gran momento.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Hay que anclarlas?</h3><p>Sí; placas y tacos según la solera.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Es obligatoria la placa de carga?</h3><p>Debe indicar la carga admisible por nivel y total.</p></div>","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_h3":"¿Necesita estanterías de carga pesada o cantilever?","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_p":"Envíe los planos de diseño; ofertaremos las estanterías soldadas.","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_btn":"Solicitar oferta →","blog_related_h":"Artículos relacionados","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Fabricación de Estructuras Metálicas: del Diseño al Montaje","blog_p14_strength_h1":"Cálculo de resistencia de soldaduras: en ángulo y a tope según EN 1993-1-8","blog_p04_iso13920_h1":"Tolerancias generales ISO 13920: tabla para construcciones soldadas y elección de la clase","blog_p19_boltweld_h1":"¿Soldada o atornillada? Guía técnica para elegir la unión"},"fr":{"blog_p94_heavyrack_title":"Rayonnages lourds et cantilever : solutions soudées quand le standard ne suffit pas | ArmaWeld","blog_p94_heavyrack_meta_desc":"Fabrication soudée de racks à outillages, racks à bobines, rayonnages cantilever et stockage de produits longs : calcul des charges, liaison des bras, ancrage, flèche, plaques de charge, peinture et montage.","blog_p94_heavyrack_og_title":"Rayonnages lourds et cantilever","blog_p94_heavyrack_tag":"Guide produit · Stockage","blog_p94_heavyrack_h1":"Rayonnages lourds et cantilever : solutions soudées quand le standard ne suffit pas","blog_p94_heavyrack_breadcrumb3":"Rayonnages lourds","blog_p94_heavyrack_read":"6 min de lecture","blog_p94_heavyrack_body":"<p>Les rayonnages à palettes sont surtout des systèmes profilés à froid, fabriqués en série et boulonnés, conçus selon leurs propres normes. Certaines charges n'y entrent pas : outils de presse de plusieurs tonnes, bobines, profilés et tubes de 12 m, pièces de machines. Pour elles, on conçoit et soude des racks spécifiques en profilés laminés à chaud.</p>\n<h2>Types spéciaux courants</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Racks à outillages :</strong> à tiroirs ou fixes ; plateaux en tôle forte ou caillebotis.</li>\n<li><strong>Racks à bobines :</strong> berceaux en V.</li>\n<li><strong>Cantilever :</strong> à bras simple ou double face pour produits longs.</li>\n<li><strong>Verticaux et alvéolaires :</strong> pour tôles et profilés longs.</li>\n<li><strong>Supports et palettes :</strong> stockage interne de pièces lourdes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Charge et conception</h2>\n<p>Il faut calculer la charge par niveau, la charge au poteau, la flèche en bout de bras et la sécurité au basculement. Sur un cantilever, la liaison bras-poteau est le point le plus critique : la charge en bout de bras y crée un fort moment. Si elle est soudée, le cordon doit être dimensionné (voir <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-mukavemet-hesabi.html\">calcul des cordons</a>) ; pour des bras réglables, on préfère des liaisons boulonnées ou à broches (voir <a href=\"kaynakli-mi-civatali-mi-birlestirme.html\">soudé ou boulonné</a>).</p>\n<h2>Ancrage et flèche</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Les rayonnages sont ancrés ; platines et chevilles adaptées à la dalle.</li>\n<li>Protections de pied contre les chocs de chariots.</li>\n<li>Flèche en bout de bras limitée pour éviter glissement de charge et déformation permanente.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Fabrication et cotes</h2>\n<p>L'alignement des logements de bras sur les poteaux garde les bras horizontaux et au même niveau. Les entraxes sont tenus par gabarit ou découpe CNC ; la classe ISO 13920 doit être indiquée (voir <a href=\"iso-13920-kaynakli-imalat-tolerans-tablosu.html\">ISO 13920</a>).</p>\n<h2>Plaque de charge et sécurité</h2>\n<p>Chaque rayonnage porte une plaque indiquant la charge admissible par niveau et totale. Elle ne doit pas être dépassée ; poteaux et bras endommagés sont remplacés lors des inspections périodiques.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Chez ArmaWeld :</strong> nous soudons racks à outillages, à bobines et cantilever selon la conception validée du client, tenons l'alignement des logements par gabarit et livrons avec un rapport dimensionnel. Découpe et peinture sont coordonnées avec nos partenaires. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Charpente métallique →</a></p></div>","blog_p94_heavyrack_faq":"<h2>Questions fréquentes</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quand faut-il un rack spécial ?</h3><p>Pour des charges lourdes ou longues : outillages, bobines, profilés longs.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Point le plus critique d'un cantilever ?</h3><p>La liaison bras-poteau ; un fort moment s'y développe.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Faut-il ancrer les rayonnages ?</h3><p>Oui ; platines et chevilles adaptées à la dalle.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>La plaque de charge est-elle requise ?</h3><p>Elle doit indiquer la charge admissible par niveau et totale.</p></div>","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_h3":"Besoin de rayonnages lourds ou cantilever ?","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_p":"Envoyez les plans de conception ; nous chiffrerons les racks soudés.","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_btn":"Demander un devis →","blog_related_h":"Articles associés","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Fabrication de Charpentes Métalliques : du Calcul au Montage","blog_p14_strength_h1":"Calcul de résistance des soudures : angle et bout à bout selon l’EN 1993-1-8","blog_p04_iso13920_h1":"Tolérances générales ISO 13920 : tableau pour constructions soudées et choix de la classe","blog_p19_boltweld_h1":"Soudé ou boulonné ? Guide technique pour choisir l’assemblage"},"it":{"blog_p94_heavyrack_title":"Scaffalature pesanti e cantilever: soluzioni saldate quando lo standard non basta | ArmaWeld","blog_p94_heavyrack_meta_desc":"Produzione saldata di scaffali per stampi, per coil, cantilever e per materiali lunghi: calcolo dei carichi, attacco dei bracci, ancoraggio, freccia, targhe di portata, verniciatura e montaggio.","blog_p94_heavyrack_og_title":"Scaffalature pesanti e cantilever","blog_p94_heavyrack_tag":"Guida prodotto · Magazzino","blog_p94_heavyrack_h1":"Scaffalature pesanti e cantilever: soluzioni saldate quando lo standard non basta","blog_p94_heavyrack_breadcrumb3":"Scaffalature pesanti","blog_p94_heavyrack_read":"6 min di lettura","blog_p94_heavyrack_body":"<p>Le scaffalature portapallet sono in gran parte sistemi profilati a freddo, prodotti in serie e imbullonati, progettati secondo norme proprie. Alcuni carichi non ci stanno: stampi da più tonnellate, coil, profili e tubi da 12 metri, parti di macchine. Per questi si progettano e saldano scaffali su misura con profili laminati a caldo.</p>\n<h2>Tipi speciali</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Scaffali per stampi:</strong> a cassetti o fissi; ripiani in lamiera spessa o grigliato.</li>\n<li><strong>Scaffali per coil:</strong> con selle a V.</li>\n<li><strong>Cantilever:</strong> a bracci mono o bifronte per materiali lunghi.</li>\n<li><strong>Verticali e a cassetti:</strong> per lamiere e profili lunghi.</li>\n<li><strong>Rastrelliere e pallet:</strong> stoccaggio interno di pezzi pesanti.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Carico e progetto</h2>\n<p>Vanno calcolati carico per livello, carico sul montante, freccia in punta al braccio e sicurezza al ribaltamento. Nel cantilever il collegamento braccio-montante è il punto più critico: il carico in punta vi genera un forte momento. Se saldato, il cordone va dimensionato (vedi <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-mukavemet-hesabi.html\">calcolo dei cordoni</a>); per bracci regolabili si preferiscono collegamenti imbullonati o a perno (vedi <a href=\"kaynakli-mi-civatali-mi-birlestirme.html\">saldato o bullonato</a>).</p>\n<h2>Ancoraggio e freccia</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Gli scaffali si ancorano; piastre e tasselli adatti alla pavimentazione.</li>\n<li>Paracolpi per i montanti contro urti dei carrelli.</li>\n<li>Freccia in punta contenuta per evitare scivolamenti e deformazioni permanenti.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Produzione e quote</h2>\n<p>L'allineamento delle sedi dei bracci sui montanti mantiene i bracci orizzontali e allo stesso livello. Gli interassi si tengono con maschere o taglio CNC; va indicata la classe ISO 13920 (vedi <a href=\"iso-13920-kaynakli-imalat-tolerans-tablosu.html\">ISO 13920</a>).</p>\n<h2>Targa di portata e sicurezza</h2>\n<p>Ogni scaffale deve avere una targa con la portata ammessa per livello e totale. Non va superata; montanti e bracci danneggiati si sostituiscono nelle ispezioni periodiche.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>In ArmaWeld:</strong> saldiamo scaffali per stampi, coil e cantilever secondo il progetto approvato dal cliente, teniamo l'allineamento delle sedi con maschere e consegniamo con rapporto dimensionale. Taglio e verniciatura sono coordinati con i partner. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Carpenteria metallica →</a></p></div>","blog_p94_heavyrack_faq":"<h2>Domande frequenti</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quando serve uno scaffale speciale?</h3><p>Per carichi pesanti o lunghi come stampi, coil o profili lunghi.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Punto più critico del cantilever?</h3><p>Il collegamento braccio-montante, dove nasce un forte momento.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Gli scaffali vanno ancorati?</h3><p>Sì; piastre e tasselli adatti al pavimento.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Serve la targa di portata?</h3><p>Deve indicare la portata per livello e totale.</p></div>","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_h3":"Servono scaffalature pesanti o cantilever?","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_p":"Inviate i disegni di progetto; quoteremo gli scaffali saldati.","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_btn":"Richiedi offerta →","blog_related_h":"Articoli correlati","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Carpenteria metallica: dalla progettazione al montaggio","blog_p14_strength_h1":"Calcolo di resistenza delle saldature: d’angolo e testa a testa secondo EN 1993-1-8","blog_p04_iso13920_h1":"Tolleranze generali ISO 13920: tabella per costruzioni saldate e scelta della classe","blog_p19_boltweld_h1":"Saldato o bullonato? Guida tecnica alla scelta del collegamento"},"nl":{"blog_p94_heavyrack_title":"Zware stellingen en draagarmstellingen: gelaste oplossingen als standaard niet volstaat | ArmaWeld","blog_p94_heavyrack_meta_desc":"Gelaste productie van matrijsstellingen, coilstellingen, draagarmstellingen en opslag voor lang materiaal: lastberekening, armaansluiting, verankering, doorbuiging, belastingborden, lakken en montage.","blog_p94_heavyrack_og_title":"Zware stellingen en draagarmstellingen","blog_p94_heavyrack_tag":"Productgids · Opslag","blog_p94_heavyrack_h1":"Zware stellingen en draagarmstellingen: gelaste oplossingen als standaard niet volstaat","blog_p94_heavyrack_breadcrumb3":"Zware stellingen","blog_p94_heavyrack_read":"6 min lezen","blog_p94_heavyrack_body":"<p>Palletstellingen zijn grotendeels koudgevormde, in serie gemaakte, geboute systemen volgens eigen normen. Sommige lasten passen daar niet in: persmatrijzen van tonnen, staalcoils, profielen en buizen van 12 meter, machinedelen. Daarvoor worden meestal projectspecifieke stellingen uit warmgewalste profielen ontworpen en gelast.</p>\n<h2>Typische speciale stellingen</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Matrijsstellingen:</strong> met laden of vast; legborden van dikke plaat of rooster.</li>\n<li><strong>Coilstellingen:</strong> met V-zadels of wiegen.</li>\n<li><strong>Draagarmstellingen:</strong> enkel- of dubbelzijdig voor lang materiaal.</li>\n<li><strong>Verticale en ladestellingen:</strong> voor platen en lange profielen.</li>\n<li><strong>Bokken en ladingdragers:</strong> interne opslag van zware delen.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Last en ontwerp</h2>\n<p>Bereken last per niveau, kolomlast, doorbuiging aan de armpunt en kantelveiligheid. Bij een draagarmstelling is de arm-kolomverbinding het meest kritisch: de last aan de armpunt geeft daar een groot moment. Is die gelast, dan moet de las worden berekend (zie <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-mukavemet-hesabi.html\">lasberekening</a>); voor verstelbare armen hebben geboute of gepende verbindingen de voorkeur (zie <a href=\"kaynakli-mi-civatali-mi-birlestirme.html\">lassen of bouten</a>).</p>\n<h2>Verankering en doorbuiging</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Stellingen worden verankerd; voetplaten en ankers passend bij de vloer.</li>\n<li>Aanrijdbeveiliging van kolommen tegen heftruckschade.</li>\n<li>Doorbuiging aan de armpunt beperken zodat de last niet schuift en de arm niet blijvend vervormt.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Productie en maten</h2>\n<p>De uitlijning van armopnames op de kolommen houdt de armen horizontaal en op gelijke hoogte. Gat- en opnameafstanden worden daarom met mallen of CNC-snijden aangehouden; vermeld de ISO 13920-klasse (zie <a href=\"iso-13920-kaynakli-imalat-tolerans-tablosu.html\">ISO 13920</a>).</p>\n<h2>Belastingbord en veiligheid</h2>\n<p>Elke stelling krijgt een bord met toelaatbare last per niveau en totaal. Die mag niet worden overschreden; beschadigde kolommen en armen worden bij periodieke inspecties vervangen.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Bij ArmaWeld:</strong> we lassen matrijs-, coil- en draagarmstellingen volgens het goedgekeurde ontwerp van de klant, houden de armopnames met mallen in lijn en leveren met maatrapport. Snijden en lakken coördineren we met partners. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Staalconstructies →</a></p></div>","blog_p94_heavyrack_faq":"<h2>Veelgestelde vragen</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Wanneer een speciale stelling?</h3><p>Bij zware of lange lasten zoals matrijzen, coils of lange profielen.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Meest kritisch bij draagarmstellingen?</h3><p>De arm-kolomverbinding; daar ontstaat een groot moment.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Moeten stellingen worden verankerd?</h3><p>Ja; voetplaten en ankers passend bij de vloer.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Is een belastingbord nodig?</h3><p>Ja, met toelaatbare last per niveau en totaal.</p></div>","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_h3":"Zware stellingen of draagarmstellingen nodig?","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_p":"Stuur de ontwerptekeningen; we offreren de gelaste stellingen.","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_btn":"Offerte aanvragen →","blog_related_h":"Gerelateerde artikelen","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Staalbouw: van ontwerp tot montage","blog_p14_strength_h1":"Sterkteberekening van lassen: hoek- en stompe lassen volgens EN 1993-1-8","blog_p04_iso13920_h1":"ISO 13920 algemene toleranties: tabel voor lasconstructies en de juiste klasse kiezen","blog_p19_boltweld_h1":"Gelast of gebout? Een technische gids voor de keuze van de verbinding"},"no":{"blog_p94_heavyrack_title":"Tungreoler og grenreoler: sveiste løsninger når standardreoler ikke strekker til | ArmaWeld","blog_p94_heavyrack_meta_desc":"Sveiset produksjon av verktøyreoler, coilreoler, grenreoler og lagring av langgods: lastberegning, armtilkobling, forankring, nedbøyning, lastskilt, maling og montasje.","blog_p94_heavyrack_og_title":"Tungreoler og grenreoler","blog_p94_heavyrack_tag":"Produktguide · Lagring","blog_p94_heavyrack_h1":"Tungreoler og grenreoler: sveiste løsninger når standardreoler ikke strekker til","blog_p94_heavyrack_breadcrumb3":"Tungreoler","blog_p94_heavyrack_read":"6 min lesing","blog_p94_heavyrack_body":"<p>Pallreoler er i stor grad kaldformede, serieproduserte, boltede systemer med egne standarder. Noen laster passer ikke inn: pressverktøy på flere tonn, stålcoiler, 12-meters profiler og rør, maskindeler. For disse konstrueres og sveises prosjektspesifikke reoler av varmvalsede profiler.</p>\n<h2>Typiske spesialreoler</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Verktøyreoler:</strong> med skuffer eller faste; hyller av tykk plate eller rist.</li>\n<li><strong>Coilreoler:</strong> med V-saler eller vugger.</li>\n<li><strong>Grenreoler:</strong> en- eller tosidige for langgods.</li>\n<li><strong>Vertikal- og skuffreoler:</strong> for plater og lange profiler.</li>\n<li><strong>Stativer og lastbærere:</strong> intern lagring av tunge deler.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Last og konstruksjon</h2>\n<p>Det må beregnes last per nivå, søylelast, nedbøyning i armspissen og veltesikkerhet. I grenreoler er arm-søyle-forbindelsen det mest kritiske punktet: lasten i armspissen gir et stort moment der. Er den sveiset, må sveisen dimensjoneres (se <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-mukavemet-hesabi.html\">sveiseberegning</a>); for justerbare armer foretrekkes boltede eller pinnede forbindelser (se <a href=\"kaynakli-mi-civatali-mi-birlestirme.html\">sveiset eller boltet</a>).</p>\n<h2>Forankring og nedbøyning</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Reoler forankres; fotplater og ankere velges etter gulvet.</li>\n<li>Påkjørselsvern for søyler mot truckstøt.</li>\n<li>Nedbøyning i armspissen begrenses så lasten ikke sklir og armen ikke får varig deformasjon.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Produksjon og mål</h2>\n<p>Oppretting av armfester på søylene holder armene vannrette og på samme høyde. Hull- og festeavstander holdes derfor med fikstur eller CNC-kutting; ISO 13920-klassen skal angis (se <a href=\"iso-13920-kaynakli-imalat-tolerans-tablosu.html\">ISO 13920</a>).</p>\n<h2>Lastskilt og sikkerhet</h2>\n<p>Hver reol skal ha skilt med tillatt last per nivå og totalt. Den skal ikke overskrides, og skadde søyler og armer byttes ved periodisk kontroll.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Hos ArmaWeld:</strong> vi sveiser verktøy-, coil- og grenreoler etter kundens godkjente konstruksjon, holder armfestene på linje med fikstur og leverer med målrapport. Kutting og maling koordineres med partnere. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Stålkonstruksjoner →</a></p></div>","blog_p94_heavyrack_faq":"<h2>Ofte stilte spørsmål</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Når trengs en spesialreol?</h3><p>For tunge eller lange laster som verktøy, coiler eller lange profiler.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Mest kritisk i en grenreol?</h3><p>Arm-søyle-forbindelsen; der oppstår et stort moment.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Må reoler forankres?</h3><p>Ja; fotplater og ankere tilpasset gulvet.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Er lastskilt nødvendig?</h3><p>Ja, med tillatt last per nivå og totalt.</p></div>","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_h3":"Trenger du tungreoler eller grenreoler?","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_p":"Send konstruksjonstegningene; vi gir tilbud på sveiste reoler.","blog_p94_heavyrack_cta_btn":"Be om tilbud →","blog_related_h":"Relaterte artikler","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Stålkonstruksjonsproduksjon: Fra design til montasje","blog_p14_strength_h1":"Fasthetsberegning av sveis: kil- og buttsveis etter EN 1993-1-8","blog_p04_iso13920_h1":"ISO 13920 generelle toleranser: tabell for sveisekonstruksjoner og valg av riktig klasse","blog_p19_boltweld_h1":"Sveiset eller boltet? En teknisk veiledning for valg av forbindelse"}};for(var l in d){var t=T[l]||(T[l]={});for(var k in d[l])t[k]=d[l][k];}})();
